  "usage_note": "This entry covers **tomorrow** when it says when something happens. As the subject of a sentence (*Tomorrow is Friday*), with **'s** (*tomorrow's meeting*), or after a preposition (*until tomorrow*), **tomorrow** is a noun, which has its own entry. It is spelled with one **m** and two **r**s.",
